10 July 1937. Contributed by Gerard Killoran. Biog note (original research JS):
"Mrs D. E. Budge, of Kilmacolm, who did so well in the third class tourney in
Folkestone, was, before her recent marriage Miss Benson, of Scarborough, we
understand; and of a well-known chess-playing family in the popular Yorkshire
coast resort." (Falkirk Herald, 5 July 1933) From BMD records: Esme H Benson
married Douglas E Budge, at Malton, N. Riding of Yorks., Apr-May-Jun 1933.
Esme Hewetson Benson, b 20 Feb 1907 (Filey, N. Yorks), d May 1998 (N. Yorks.).
Douglas Enty Budge, b Apr 1891 (Cheshire), d 25 Aug 1951 (Kilmacolm, Scotland).
} 1-0

